      "result": "Implemented the URL shortener API with Rails 8.0.2 and PostgreSQL persistence. `sh start.sh` applies pending migrations and runs the server in the foreground on `0.0.0.0:8000`; the script is executable, and startup instructions are in the README.\n\nVerified the API over HTTP: creation, generated and custom codes, validation errors, duplicate codes, listing, lookup, redirects, and unknown-code responses. A saved link survived a server restart, and a redirect increased its click count exactly once. Rails eager loading also passed.",
